  {
   "id": "R23-F1-NEW",
   "severity": "MODERATE",
   "state": "OPEN",
   "summary": "work/twentieth-forward/selftest-cross-pins.mjs does not run at this commit. Its sandbox copies scripts/phase2-qualification and work/twentieth-forward and symlinks apps/clued-cloud, but the manifest gained skills/clued/SKILL.md, skills/clued/references/engineering.md and skills/clued/references/memory-operations.md, which the sandbox never creates, so remeasure() dies with ENOENT on skills/clued/SKILL.md before any case runs. It fails closed (exit 1), so nothing is silently green, but the declared 4/4 is not obtained from the committed file. Adding a recursive copy of skills/ into the sandbox makes it report 4/4 plus the restore case, with every declared failure mode producing CROSS_PIN_FAILURE and exit 1. That one-line change is NOT made here: selftest-cross-pins.mjs is outside the manifest and outside the controller, and the freeze is respected."
  },
